		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Undead made from the corpses of wartime dead. Amalgamation of limbs, weapons, and flesh birthed from battlefields via profane magic or godly whims.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 44, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 slam +7 (2d6) or 1 scrap ball (far) +5 (2d6) or absorb dying, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 9</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Absorb Dying</strong>. Absorb dying creature within close, instantly killing it and regaining 2d6 HP.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
